// Core primitives are compiler-known opaque types. `is` declares a nominal refinement, and `with`
// pins the supplied-slot contract that ordinary Tao declarations fill.
primitive item

primitive number

primitive text

primitive boolean

primitive list

primitive time

primitive action

primitive design

// Rendering and presentability are independent roles. Every presentable is visual, while an
// embeddable view, layout, or frame is not thereby directly presentable by a navigator.
primitive visual

primitive presentable is visual

primitive view is visual

primitive layout is visual

primitive frame is visual

primitive ui is presentable

primitive nav is presentable with {
   implement,
}

primitive datasource with {
   implement,
}

primitive app with {
   Name text,
   Navigator nav,
   Datasource datasource is none,
   Design design is none,
}
